		{"id":"6f0ab3ae99d14b8b","type":"text","x":-109,"y":-2040,"width":220,"height":80,"text":"**部分基金制（部分积累制）**"},
		{"id":"81b6ef5441b541f5","type":"text","x":141,"y":-2040,"width":220,"height":80,"text":"**部分要素税**"},
		{"id":"ff20caba676c4652","type":"text","x":-359,"y":-1930,"width":220,"height":80,"text":"**重新解释拉姆齐法则**"},
		{"id":"c6130b2840564374","type":"text","x":-109,"y":-1930,"width":220,"height":80,"text":"**问题**"},
		{"id":"673719ea5d464012","type":"text","x":141,"y":-1930,"width":220,"height":80,"text":"**问题描述与分析**"},
		{"id":"9cbd80f0a1dc42fc","type":"text","x":-359,"y":-1820,"width":220,"height":80,"text":"**需要处理好的问题**"},
		{"id":"ee4e97a319da49d5","type":"text","x":-109,"y":-1820,"width":220,"height":80,"text":"**非税收入**"},
		{"id":"fac9b0431dea40ac","type":"text","x":141,"y":-1820,"width":220,"height":80,"text":"**Production Possibility Frontier (PPF)**"},
		{"id":"fc1464c3e1564495","type":"text","x":-359,"y":-1710,"width":220,"height":80,"text":"**Property Rights**"},
		{"id":"22d6a687d63d461c","type":"text","x":-109,"y":-1710,"width":220,"height":80,"text":"**XY相关不代表二者有因果关系**"},
		{"id":"dce65a3deb214528","type":"text","x":141,"y":-1710,"width":220,"height":80,"text":"**一个人能用，别人也能用，我们称之为“没有竞争性”，一个人能用了别人就不能用，我们称之为有“竞争性**"},
		{"id":"1ed84a78204046b1","type":"text","x":-359,"y":-1600,"width":220,"height":80,"text":"**一件商品在实际使用时，雇主能不能够方便的把其他的使用者排除在外，如果能比较方便地做到，就说明它有“排他性”，不方便做到，就说明它不具有“排他性”。**"},
		{"id":"0ec3d60b63ff4c42","type":"text","x":-109,"y":-1600,"width":220,"height":80,"text":"**实证分析的重要部分**"},
		{"id":"b68e50cd64234c97","type":"text","x":141,"y":-1600,"width":220,"height":80,"text":"**第二定律讲的是公平和效率之间的取舍，将初始资源进行一次再分配，而后任由其发展**"},
		{"id":"0450e976cdc14160","type":"text","x":-359,"y":-1490,"width":220,"height":80,"text":"**随着人均收入的提高，财政支出占GDP比重也相应随之提高**"},
		{"id":"fde48e875ddc4792","type":"text","x":-109,"y":-1490,"width":220,"height":80,"text":"**01_公共物品public goods**"},
